<li>Sistem kendali: sistem kendali inersial.</li>
<li>Hulu ledak: torpedo Mark 46, 45&amp;nbsp;kg.</li>
<li>Mulai digunakan: 1993 (RUM139A); 1996 (RUM139B)</li>
</ul>
